\[Y^{\prime}_{r}(\!+z\nu^{1/3})\!\sim\!\frac{2^{2/3}}{p^{1/3}}\,\mathrm{Ai}\,(-2 ^{1/3}z)\,\left\{1\!+\!\sum_{k=1}^{n}\frac{f_{k}(z)}{p^{2k/3}}\right\}\] \[+\frac{2^{2/3}}{p}\,\mathrm{Ai}^{\prime}\,(-2^{1/3}z)\,\sum_{k=0} ^{n}\frac{g_{k}(z)}{p^{2k/3}}\] \[\textbf{9.3.24}\] \[Y_{r}(\!+z\nu^{1/3})\!\sim\!-\frac{2^{1/3}}{p^{1/3}}\,\mathrm{Bi} \,(-2^{1/3}z)\,\left\{1\!+\!\sum_{k=1}^{n}\frac{f_{k}(z)}{p^{2k/3}}\right\}\] \[-\frac{2^{2/3}}{p}\,\mathrm{Bi}^{\prime}\,(-2^{1/3}z)\,\sum_{k=0} ^{n}\frac{g_{k}(z)}{p^{2k/3}}\] where \[\textbf{9.3.25}\] \[f_{1}(z)\!=\!-\frac{1}{5}\,z\] \[f_{2}(z)\!=\!-\frac{9}{100}\,z^{3}\!+\!\frac{3}{35}z^{2}\] \[f_{3}(z)\!=\!\frac{957}{7000}\,z^{4}\!-\!\frac{173}{3150}\,z^{3} \!-\!\frac{1}{225}\] The corresponding expansions for \(H_{r}^{(1)}(\wp+z\nu^{1/3})\) and \(H_{r}^{(2)}(\wp+z\nu^{1/3})\) are obtained by use of **9.1.3** and **9.1.4;** they are valid for \(-\frac{1}{2}r\!<\!\arg r\!<\!\frac{3}{2}\pi\) and \(-\frac{3}{2}r\!<\!\arg r\!<\!\frac{3}{2}\pi\), respectively.

